<h2 id="integration-acceptance">Integration acceptance</h2>

- Test add, update, complete, delete and clear only where they are supported. Include a repeated submit and an uncertain save.
- Check that date-only items, timed reminders and the route to completed items keep their meanings.
- Check focus after reordering or filtering, and tell empty results apart from unavailable data.

Record the environment, versions, state, method and result with [Native task accessibility and evidence](native-task-accessibility.html). Source review and a simulated example do not show real device behaviour, screen reader use or live compatibility. For the wording of saved and pending states, see [States, requests and errors](../content/writing-guidelines/states-and-errors.html).
